  "title": "WLAN: Correct description of `wlan.fc.type_subtype`.",
  "description": "This corrects the description of `wlan.fc.type_subtype`.\n\nFor most of the MAC frames, type and subtype are actually the last _nibbles_, instead of bytes.\nOnly for Control Frame Extension subtypes (type 1, subtype 6), they are represented as first + last byte.",
